     "t": "Swadeshi and Boycott; Lucknow 1916; Home Rule 1917",
     "items": [
      [
       "b",
       "**Swadeshi + Boycott (Partition of Bengal period):** Congress / nationalist movement; boycott foreign goods + promote indigenous goods + national education. Bengal Partition agitation → Swadeshi + Boycott.",
       "Indian History #111"
      ],
      [
       "b",
       "**Congress–League Agreement, 1916:** Lucknow Session, President **Ambika Charan Majumdar**; Congress + Muslim League agreement.",
       "Indian History #111"
