      [
       "b",
       "**Home Rule Movement, 1917:** Annie Besant; Annie Besant also became INC President at Calcutta, 1917.",
       "Indian History #111"
      ]
     ]
    },
    {
     "t": "Nehru Report and the Calcutta ultimatum, 1928",
